# JSON Schema files defeat graphify's data-JSON heuristic (#1224): they carry
# $schema/$ref, so _is_config_json classifies them as config and walks every
# key to depth 6. Result on this repo: 12,055 nodes (45% of the graph) that are
# JSON Schema *syntax* (type x1833, $ref x561, additionalProperties x428),
# not concepts. They bloat every query budget and corrupt label matching.
schemas/
*.schema.json
